{
  "_comment": [
    "PixelLab's official MCP server. Copy this file to .mcp.json, paste your key,",
    "and restart Claude Code — the PixelLab tools then appear directly in the",
    "session instead of only through `npm run pixellab`.",
    "",
    ".mcp.json is gitignored because it holds a live key and this repo is public.",
    "The .example stays committed so the setup is discoverable.",
    "",
    "Two ways to use PixelLab, and they are for different jobs:",
    "  npm run pixellab  — batch. Reads art/pixellab-queue.json, generates every",
    "                      subject that has no sheet yet, prices itself with",
    "                      --list first. Use it to work down the roadmap.",
    "  this MCP server   — conversational. Lets Claude call the tools directly,",
    "                      including the ones the script does not wrap: 8-direction",
    "                      sprites, Generate 8 rotations, Animate with text, tilesets,",
    "                      Portrait <-> Character, and the free utilities (Unzoom,",
    "                      Reduce colors, Pixel art correction). Use it for one-off",
    "                      work and for anything needing directional or animated",
    "                      output, which the batch script deliberately does not do."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "pixellab": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://api.pixellab.ai/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer PASTE_YOUR_PIXELLAB_KEY_HERE"
      }
    }
  }
}
